2 CONC f Doux & Ferreira (Casa Oriental, rua dos Ourives 49, 1889), and lived at rua Senador Vergueiro 2. In 1884 he and A. C. Siqueira were the heirs of his mother-in-law Luiza Pontiroli in Rio Grande. He d
2 CONC ied at Taubaté on 10 Nov 1904. His son Alfredo (Jr.) [I500062] married Rosa in Vienna on 4 Nov 1915, and their son Henry Robert Emile Doux was born in Zürich on 18 Aug 1918. In 1925 the son sued his p
2 CONC aternal grandmother Celestina Filippini Doux for maintenance. (research 2026-11-21, probable)
