1 NOTE Buenos Aires sources call him 'Bernardo Artayeta' and describe him as a French saddler ('talabartero francés'). On 9 Jul 1794 he and his wife Estefanía Centurión bound themselves to repay 500 pesos to
2 CONC  María Josefa de Lajarrota de Aguirre; the debt was settled on 15 Jun 1809 before the notary Antonio Agrelo. The death date the tree once had for him (5 NOV 1871, 'aged about 106-107') is the one give
2 CONC n for his son Coronel Mariano Artayeta Centurión (b. 11 Sep 1802) and was removed. Genealogía Familiar gives his death as 'fecha desconocida'. (research 2026-11-20, probable)
