2 CONC ' as son of João de Frontoura and Leonor Mendes de Nogueira; Carneiros §33 calls the husband of Maria Carneiro Vieira 'fº de João Fontoura m.or em Chaves e Leonor Mendes Nogueira'). It is the same man
2 CONC : same wife (I500193), Chaves, fidalgo of the House of Bragança and its Mordomo-mor (matching the tree note), and son Francisco Carneiro Fontoura (I500190). The Dicionário das Famílias Brasileiras and
2 CONC  carneirodafontoura.com independently make João de Fontoura the father (without naming the mother). A Silveira genealogy quoted on Geneall gives the couple João da Fontoura x Leonor Mendes de Nogueira
